   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Recompute everything (SPEC 7). Trust no derived field.\n1  server receipt chain, no gaps\n2  client chain per session: hash, sig, prev_hash, genesis/seal\n3  arrival order, no replay or reorder\n4  rebuild Merkle root, check RFC 3161 cert chain\n5  time bound from the anchor  6  pin vs head\n...14  OpenTimestamps",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r0074",
   "originalText": "Recompute everything (SPEC 7). Trust no derived field.\n1  server receipt chain, no gaps\n2  client chain per session: hash, sig, prev_hash, genesis/seal\n3  arrival order, no replay or reorder\n4  rebuild Merkle root, check RFC 3161 cert chain\n5  time bound from the anchor  6  pin vs head\n...14  OpenTimestamps",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
