   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Trust boundary, deliberately\nThe operator trades as a Lithuanian individuali veikla with no liability shield, so Provenrail never hosts customer agent records:\nhosting them would make him a GDPR processor personally. The customer self-hosts the AGPL sink and keeps every record.\nWhat is sold is the one thing a self-hoster cannot manufacture alone: an independent, third-party-timestamped anchor.\ndocs/PRD-anchor-only-service.md  -  docs/cost-to-execute-2026-08-18.md",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r0109",
   "originalText": "Trust boundary, deliberately\nThe operator trades as a Lithuanian individuali veikla with no liability shield, so Provenrail never hosts customer agent records:\nhosting them would make him a GDPR processor personally. The customer self-hosts the AGPL sink and keeps every record.\nWhat is sold is the one thing a self-hoster cannot manufacture alone: an independent, third-party-timestamped anchor.\ndocs/PRD-anchor-only-service.md  -  docs/cost-to-execute-2026-08-18.md",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
